      "summary": "RP2040 PIO assembly programs implementing SPI, dual-SPI, and quad-SPI (QSPI) data transfers for WIZnet W6300 QSPI_QUAD_MODE communication.",
      "tags": ["hardware-driver", "pio", "spi"],
      "complexity": "moderate",
      "languageNotes": "Three separate PIO programs for SPI, dual-SPI, and quad-SPI; each handles command/address phase plus payload using sideset for clock generation."
